stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> awaiting_approval: preparePayouts
  awaiting_approval --> approved: passkey approval, caps, balance
  awaiting_approval --> failed: discarded (stale or replaced)
  approved --> order_created: Paycrest order created
  approved --> funding: USDC payout passes barrier
  approved --> failed: paused, quote error, wallet inactive, refused, no order in 15 min
  approved --> needs_review: ambiguous createOrder, no order id after 2 min
  order_created --> funding: funding barrier passed
  order_created --> failed: checkOrder fails, paused, expired, cancelled
  order_created --> needs_review: unexpected Paycrest status
  funding --> paying: USDC sent, or Paycrest saw the deposit
  funding --> failed: send refused
  funding --> needs_review: send outcome unknown, over 10 min, expired
  paying --> paid: Paycrest validated or settled, onchain receipt matches
  paying --> failed: Paycrest refunded (USDC back as a refund row)
  paying --> needs_review: expired, cancelled, over 2 h, receipt mismatch
  needs_review --> paid: staff resolve with second confirmation
  needs_review --> failed: staff resolve with second confirmation
  paid --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
  note right of failed
    Retry creates a new payout for the same subject
    with a new key and needs a fresh approval
  end note
